WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,870
I have spent seven or eight years in the circle of the rich second generation in Xiangcheng.

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:04,470
Clip up the little internet celebrities you have played with

3
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:06,070
None of these guys are pretty either.

4
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:09,510
Where did this guy come from as a monster brother?

5
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:10,760
You came here with them

6
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:11,880
You must know that man

7
00:00:11,880 --> 00:00:15,280
Which referee is he from Yanjing? Or is he from Motoland? Are you thinking too much?

8
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,520
He is the super academic at our Xiangzhong University

9
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:18,080
I haven’t officially graduated yet as a senior this year.

10
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,760
A senior and a college student who has not graduated

11
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,720
Come out with eight jokes to buy a supercar. As for these beauties

12
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:23,120
All top jokes from our college town

13
00:00:23,120 --> 00:00:24,200
They just like super academics

14
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,080
This is something you can't help your nature.

15
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,120
Destinies are born different

16
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,400
Someone was born in Rome

17
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,520
Some people are born as cows and horses

18
00:00:29,520 --> 00:00:31,880
And you are obviously the latter, don’t get me wrong, brother.

19
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,840
I'm talking about the guy who picks up girls.

20
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:35,720
You and the others deliberately bullied me, right?

21
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,160
beauties

22
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:40,110
It turns out you are all a joke in the college town.

23
00:00:40,110 --> 00:00:42,950
No wonder all of them are born so heavy in fallen leaves

24
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:44,150
Listen to my advice

25
00:00:44,150 --> 00:00:45,590
What's good about being a college bully?

26
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,910
Even if I graduate with the best grades in the school, that’s still not the case.
